CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* binary left fold value: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* binary right fold value: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* right fold order: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* binary left fold: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] .* left fold order: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [expr.prim.fold]/1: a binary fold over the comma operator,
`(init , ... , pack)' (libstdc++ 16's C++23 <bits/funcwrap.h>) and
`(pack , ... , init)'; only the unary right fold was parsed.
